+# Feature Specification: Input validation
+
+**Created**: 2026-11-20 | **Status**: Implemented
+**Input**: Reject invalid input with a clear error when a task is added, renamed or tagged.
+
+## Requirements
+- **FR-001**: A title that is empty or only spaces is rejected.
+- **FR-002**: A title longer than 120 characters (after trimming) is rejected.
+- **FR-003**: A priority other than `low`, `normal`, `high` is rejected.
+- **FR-004**: A tag that is empty or contains a space is rejected.
+- **FR-005**: Applies to `add` (title, priority, tags), `rename` (title) and `tag` (tag).
+- **FR-006**: Rejection returns a `Result` error with code `invalid-input` and a message saying what is wrong (constitution: no throwing); the list is left unchanged.
+
+## Plan
+Validators in `src/domain/task.ts`, called by `list.ts` before any change.
+
+## Tasks
+- [x] Validators and `invalid-input` code
+- [x] Wire into add, rename, tag
+- [x] Tests
